          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nũmekĩte naĩ ngya na athĩni, nũvutanĩte, ndaatũnga ngwatĩlĩlyo, na nũmyũkĩlĩlye mĩvw’anano metho make, nĩwĩkĩte ũthatyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nũkovethetye aitũngĩwa ũtandĩthyo, na nĩwosete wongeleko; ũsu akekala thayu? Ndakekala thayũ: nĩwĩkĩte mothatyo asu onthe; ndatĩa ũkw’a; nthakame yake ĩkeethĩwa ĩũlũ wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.18.13"
            ]
          }
