        {
          "text": "nũtũngĩte kw’oko kwake ndakathĩn’ye ngya, ndaakovethya atũngĩwe ũtandĩthyo kana wongeleko, nĩwĩkĩte motw’ĩo makwa, nũendete myamũlonĩ yakwa; ũsu ndakakw’a kwondũ wa ũthũku wa ĩthe wake, ndatĩa kwĩkala thayũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
