        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ inyw’ĩ mwĩasya, Nzĩa ya Mwĩaĩi ndĩanene. Ĩthukĩĩsye, we nyũmba ya Isilaeli: Nzĩa yakwa ndĩanene? Nzĩa syenyu tisyo iteanene?",
