        {
          "text": "Na ĩngĩ, yĩla mũndũ mũthũku ũkethyũũa na kũtia ũthũku wake ũla wekie, na kwĩkaa ũla wosanaa na mĩao na ũla wa w’o, akeetangĩĩa ekale thayu. ",
