              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩkwĩthĩwa nũsũanĩaa, na kwĩthyũũa na kũtĩa mavĩtyo make onthe ala wekie, ndatĩa kwĩkala thayũ, ndakakw’a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
